                "text": "The sub-agent reported that `notes.md` contains **11 words**.\n\n**Step 10 — Summary:** I listed the directory, created `notes.md` with the two specified lines, read it back, then used the `Edit` tool to replace \"scratch\" with \"fixture\", and confirmed both a filename search (`note*` → `notes.md`) and a content search (`fixture` → line 1). I then verified error handling by reading a nonexistent file (which correctly failed as a reported tool result), wrote and ran `count.sh` to produce exactly five lines (1–5), and dispatched a sub-agent that reported `notes.md` has 11 words. All work stayed within the current working directory.",
